            "review_title": "Review at LAM Cafe",
            "review_text": "Seo_Jason\nGyeongsan, South Korea3589 contributions\n0\nGood value cafe\nJul 2023 • Family\nIt's not awkward to call it an almost Korean street.\nA small cafe located near jw.\nExtraction and steaming skills are okay, but it seems to be a problem with Vietnamese coffee beans.\nThe taste feels slightly mild and the bitterness feels strong.\nBut it's a good value coffee shop.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten August 6, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
