            "review_title": "Review at LAM Cafe",
            "review_text": "BinhCao\nNha Trang, Vietnam5 contributions\n1\nExcellent coffee, nice ambiente, delicous juice\nJul 2020\nI happened to come right on the opening day and tried the almond cookies, cappuccino for the tea time. Those the place was packed somehow it's not so noisy and the Katie Melua's song in the background just made the afternoon so relaxing. The guests all tried to keep the small place enjoyable, and the whole cosy place felt like the good spot for old friends to meet, or even when alone sipping slowly those delicious fruit juice at sunsets. I come back almost every single day there then, and still love to come back. A must try!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2020",
